 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his sons and then at Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) The second son returns home.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We are setting up a great store and we will make a great deal of money out of it.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"We will sell out the north fields, and there is the pond there and a good well. We will take that land and move the house and have it there and be rich.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung feels the ground",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son): \"Well, well, and what are you waiting for? Let the land be sold and the house moved and let us be rich. I am an old man and I would be glad to have peace.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what then, and what then?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son enters the house with his brother.",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what do you say we sell the land and move the house and be rich?\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung asks his sons what they will eat if they sell the land.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"What will you eat?\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung repeats his question about food.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what will you eat, my sons?\"",
  "[says] The second son responds to Wang Lung's question about food.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son, Wang Lung): \"We will eat grass and the wild fruits of the fields, as we did in the years of famine.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"You will eat grass and wild fruits in my house? No, no---no---\"",
  "[action] The sons shout at Wang Lung.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The sons shout at Wang Lung.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"We will have grass and wild fruits and we will say it is the fashion!\""
